Number":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"110761","synopsis":"Pechka and Nako begin exploring the grasslands, making their way past traps and opening a treasure chest filled with a huge amount of Candy. Their relief is short-lived when a mysterious forced-transport system activates, dragging every player into the plaza! Meanwhile, Akane continues her unsettling solo movements. In an instant, the game begins to tilt toward catastrophe.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8zThHTUg1ntwjKQQ4Yle2wRYjn7.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Pechka and Nako begin exploring the grasslands, making their way past traps and opening a treasure chest filled with a huge amount of Candy. Their relief is short-lived when a mysterious forced-transport system activates, dragging every player into the plaza! Meanwhile, Akane continues her unsettling solo movements. In an instant, the game begins to tilt toward catastrophe.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8zThHTUg1ntwjKQQ4Yle2wRYjn7.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","titleKey":"Episode {{number}}","titleParams":{"number":"4"},"episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17839","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"160803","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54344","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"337277","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"457780","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"110881","synopsis":"Daisy, who was supposed to have merely been eliminated from the game, suddenly dies under mysterious circumstances in the real world. When detective Detec Bell makes a shocking accusation, Fal confirms the cruel truth and declares that clearing the game is the only path to survival! Then Masked Wonder’s mutilated body is discovered, and a search begins for the culprit behind the theft of a rare item.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/umjBR6wyhpXB9w4zxKNU0YTHpML.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Daisy, who was supposed to have merely been eliminated from the game, suddenly dies under mysterious circumstances in the real world. When detective Detec Bell makes a shocking accusation, Fal confirms the cruel truth and declares that clearing the game is the only path to survival! Then Masked Wonder’s mutilated body is discovered, and a search begins for the culprit behind the theft of a rare item.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/umjBR6wyhpXB9w4zxKNU0YTHpML.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","titleKey":"Episode {{number}}","titleParams":{"number":"5"},"episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17839","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"160803","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54344","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"337277","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"457780","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"110977","synopsis":"A giant robot and a gigantic Cherna clash spectacularly in the wasteland over an item! Pechka and the others advance into a new underground area, the “Limestone Cave,” defeating monsters along the way. But just before they log out, Fal announces a merciless new rule. With death only 15 minutes away, a desperate race against time for survival begins!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3TAoOh0Q98snduOmWOVpfk9QIKo.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"A giant robot and a gigantic Cherna clash spectacularly in the wasteland over an item! Pechka and the others advance into a new underground area, the “Limestone Cave,” defeating monsters along the way. But just before they log out, Fal announce